DFToolBox
~~~~~~~~~

Version 0.2.0 - 2026-10-30
==========================

The GUI was ported from FOX to Qt 6 and gained a 3D preview.

New features:
- 3D preview of locations, characters and objects, with the game's
  baked lighting and playing animations, `.spr` paths and tween frames
- the tree can sort files by what they are ("by type"): 3d models,
  animations, localization, music, scripts, shaders, sound effects,
  textures and voice, the latter split by language
- right-click menu in the tree to export files, as they are or
  converted: textures and normal maps to PNG, Shark3D files,
  localization and savegames to text
- the export dialog can convert images and write Shark3D files unchanged
- STFU4 normal maps can be converted to PNG, see doc/stfu-format.txt
- the sound view shows position and duration and can seek
- dialog text of voice files is available right after loading, "Scan for
  Dialogs" is gone
- new dftool-model checks models and locations from the command line
- new options --version, --portable, --no-save, --show-paths and
  --user-data-dir, a startup report goes to stderr

Changes:
- Windows builds are back, as a 64-bit zip, 32-bit Windows is no longer
  offered as Qt 6 doesn't support it
- sounds are played with Qt Multimedia, SDL is no longer needed
- all `.scr` shaders are recognized as text, and voice files with a
  damaged filename as MP3
- --datadir, --configdir and --cachedir became --data-dir, --config-dir
  and --cache-dir
- dftool-insert looks for dreamfall-mods/ in the user data directory
  first, see the README
- Windows: configuration moved to %APPDATA%\dftoolbox\config\, the old
  location is still read
- relicensed from GPL-2.0-or-later to GPL-3.0-or-later


Version 0.1.0 - 2026-10-30
==========================

The last version with the FOX GUI, after a long pause. It collects the
work since the first checkin:
- bookmark loading/saving
- fixed mp3 and wav playback, using Windows functions instead of SDL
- improved recovery of pak filenames and detection of the Dreamfall
  directory
- dfmodtool and the command line tools are installed
- CMake and Nix builds, data, config and temporary directories instead
  of files next to the executable
- compiles on current GCC


Version 0.0.0 - 2006-06-16
==========================

The first checkin of the tools, the zips of 2006 on the website come
from around this time:
- view the contents of the .pak files, textures, dialog and scripts in
  the dftoolbox GUI and listen to sounds
- extract .pak files with (some) filenames
- replace files inside a .pak
- convert localisation.dat to and from .po files for translation
- convert .sir and other Shark3D files to text and back

